  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/89) by Gaaned92 (Bitbucket: [Gaaned92](https://bitbucket.org/Gaaned92), GitHub: [Gaaned92](https://github.com/Gaaned92)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nWindows10, ART master 1.3-42-g46b0f6f75  \nIt happens only on some files\n\n* download [https://discuss.pixls.us/uploads/short-url/M4aKoJmLw2P8P72lUO5UZbvSA6.dng](https://discuss.pixls.us/uploads/short-url/M4aKoJmLw2P8P72lUO5UZbvSA6.dng) from bilznn\n* use neutral profile\n* save in jpg format\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/2152475310-art-debug_DM1xiqTfav.png)\n‌\n\n```\nOutput profile_: \"RTv4_sRGB\"\nUsing \"RTv4_sRGB\" output profile\n[Thread 8632.0x2048 exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x3908 exited with code 0]\n[New Thread 8632.0x2a00]\n[Thread 8632.0x278c exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x382c exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x29d4 exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x3a10 exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x30e8 exited with code 0]\n[Thread 8632.0x1ec0 exited with code 0]\nMetadata for D:\\PHOTOS\\test3\\13.dng found in cache\nMetadata for D:\\PHOTOS\\test3\\13.dng found in cache\nwarning: Invalid parameter passed to C runtime function.\n\nwarning: Invalid parameter passed to C runtime function.\n\nWarning: Exif tag Exif.Image.InterColorProfile not encoded\nEXIF ERROR: Size of XMP JPEG segment is larger than 65535 bytes\n[Thread 8632.0x2a00 exited with code 0]\n```\n\n‌\n\nIt os ok with Tiff export.\n",
